  "text": "About Us · Our Team | CUCA AI ROBOT\nCUCA HEALTH & WELLNESS PTE. LTD. · SINGAPORE\nAI TECHNOLOGY · HEALTH · HUMAN-CENTERED INNOVATION\nC\nCUCA\nAI ROBOT · 2028\nHome\nAbout CUCA\nOur Team\nOur Business\nContact\n文A\nEnglish\n▾\nGet in Touch\n↗\nCUCA / ABOUT US & OUR PEOPLE\nTechnology for health.\nPeople for the future.\n\nBased in Singapore and connected across Asia, we bring AI robotics, health technology and intelligent wellness services into practical, human-centered settings.\n\nDiscover CUCA\n↗\nMeet Our Team\n↘\nCUCA\nHUMAN + AI\nAI ROBOTICS / AUTOMATION\nHEALTH TECH / INNOVATION\nWELLNESS / HUMAN CARE\nEST. 2024 · SINGAPORE\nTechnology with a human purpose   ↗\n01 / COMPANY PROFILE\nAbout CUCA\nMaking health tech more human.\n\nWe believe the future of wellness should be smarter, more accessible and more human.\n\nFounded in Singapore in 2024, CUCA HEALTH & WELLNESS PTE. LTD. explores the intersection of artificial intelligence and wellness through robotics, health products and new service models.\n\nOur focus combines AI, wellness, robotics and connected business platforms, bridging technology, products, physical locations and people to improve customer and partner experiences.\n\nWe value ongoing innovation, operational excellence and responsible partnerships while building practical, service-led capabilities across the region.\n\n2024\nFounded in Singapore\n03\nCore business pillars\nAI +\nHealth technology\nOUR BUSINESS / THREE PILLARS\nWhat We Do\n\nTechnology-led, service-centered solutions connecting products, real-world operations and regional partnerships.\n\n01 / ROBOTICS\nAI Robotics\n\nRobotics solutions for wellness settings, including massage, moxibustion and health-assessment applications.\n\n02 / HEALTH TECHNOLOGY\nHealth Technology\n\nConnecting wellness products, digital tools and services to support everyday health experiences.\n\n03 / WELLNESS CENTERS\nSmart Wellness Centers\n\nIntegrating intelligent devices with physical services, store operations, training and partner networks.\n\n02 / LEADERSHIP & TEAM\nOur People\n\nCombining strategic planning, business development, operations and health-tech applications to advance CUCA’s long-term goals.\n\nAll Profiles\nLoading team…\nCULTURE & VALUES\nTechnology creates value.\nPeople build trust.\n\nWe explore the intersection of technology and wellness through professionalism, transparency, collaboration and innovation.\n\n01 / TRUST\nIntegrity & Accountability\nBuilding trust with clear information and responsible processes.\n02 / INNOVATION\nInnovation & Action\nApplying technology to real-world services.\n03 / COLLABORATION\nOpenness & Collaboration\nWorking with partners to strengthen the ecosystem.\n04 / LONG-TERM\nLong-term Growth\nDeveloping capabilities for sustainable operations.\nLET'S CONNECT\nPartnerships start with a conversation.\n\nLet’s discuss AI robotics, health technology and wellness center opportunities.\n\nEmail Our Team\n↗\nBack to Home\n↗\nC\nCUCA\nAI ROBOT · 2028\n\nCUCA HEALTH & WELLNESS PTE. LTD.\nSingapore-based wellness technology and robotics applications platform.\n\nExplore CUCA\nAbout CUCA\nOur Team\nOur Business\nContact Us\ncuca13699@gmail.com\n111 Somerset Road #05-02\nSingapore 238164\n© 2026 CUCA HEALTH & WELLNESS PTE. LTD.\nConcept preview; company and team information is subject to final review.",
