"\">↗</span></a><button data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" type=\"button\" class=\"menu-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"菜单\"> ☰ </button></div></div></header><main data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><section data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"hero\" id=\"home\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container hero-content\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"hero-left\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\">CUCA / ABOUT US &amp; OUR PEOPLE</div><h1 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Technology for health.<br><em>People for the future.</em></h1><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"hero-desc\">Based in Singapore and connected across Asia, we bring AI robotics, health technology and intelligent wellness services into practical, human-centered settings.</p><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"hero-actions\"><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"#about\" class=\"hero-btn\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Discover CUCA</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">↗</span></a><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"#team\" class=\"hero-link\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Meet Our Team</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">↘</span></a></div></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"hero-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"orb a\" data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></div><div class=\"orb b\" data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></div><div class=\"orb c\" data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></div><div class=\"orb\" data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></div><div class=\"main-orb\" data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">CUCA</strong><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">HUMAN + AI</span></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"hero-tag tag-one\"><i data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></i><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">AI ROBOTICS / AUTOMATION</span></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"hero-tag tag-two\"><i data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></i><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">HEALTH TECH / INNOVATION</span></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"hero-tag tag-three\"><i data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"></i><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">WELLNESS / HUMAN CARE</span></div></div></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container hero-bottom\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">EST. 2024 · SINGAPORE</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><b data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Technology with a human purpose</b>&nbsp;&nbsp; ↗</span></div></section><section data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"about\" id=\"about\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container about-grid\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"about-header\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\">01 / COMPANY PROFILE</div><h2 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"section-heading\">About CUCA<br>Making health tech more human.</h2><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"accent-line\"></div><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"intro\">We believe the future of wellness should be smarter, more accessible and more human.</p></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"about-copy\"><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Founded in Singapore in 2024, CUCA HEALTH &amp; WELLNESS PTE. LTD. explores the intersection of artificial intelligence and wellness through robotics, health products and new service models.</p><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Our focus combines AI, wellness, robotics and connected business platforms, bridging technology, products, physical locations and people to improve customer and partner experiences.</p><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">We value ongoing innovation, operational excellence and responsible partnerships while building practical, service-led capabilities across the region.</p><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"about-stats\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"stat\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">2024</strong><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Founded in Singapore</small></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"stat\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">03</strong><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Core business pillars</small></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"stat\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">AI +</strong><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Health technology</small></div></div></div></div></section><section data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business\" id=\"business\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"section-top\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\">OUR BUSINESS / THREE PILLARS</div><h2 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"section-heading\">What We Do</h2></div><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Technology-led, service-centered solutions connecting products, real-world operations and regional partnerships.</p></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-grid\"><article data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-card\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-no\">01 / ROBOTICS</span><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-icon\"><svg data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" x=\"4\" y=\"7\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" rx=\"3\"></rect><path data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" d=\"M12 3v4M9 3h6M4 13H2m20 0h-2M8 16h8\"></path><circle data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" cx=\"9\" cy=\"12\" r=\".8\"></circle><circle data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" cx=\"15\" cy=\"12\" r=\".8\"></circle></svg></div><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">AI Robotics</h3><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Robotics solutions for wellness settings, including massage, moxibustion and health-assessment applications.</p></article><article data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-card\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-no\">02 / HEALTH TECHNOLOGY</span><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-icon\"><svg data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" d=\"M20.5 8.5c0 5.2-8.5 11-8.5 11S3.5 13.7 3.5 8.5a4.7 4.7 0 0 1 8.5-2.7 4.7 4.7 0 0 1 8.5 2.7Z\"></path><path data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" d=\"M5.5 12h4l2-3 2.1 6 1.8-3h3\"></path></svg></div><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Health Technology</h3><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Connecting wellness products, digital tools and services to support everyday health experiences.</p></article><article data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-card\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-no\">03 / WELLNESS CENTERS</span><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"business-icon\"><svg data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" d=\"M4 21V5l8-3 8 3v16M2 21h20M8 8h2m4 0h2M8 12h2m4 0h2M10 21v-5h4v5\"></path></svg></div><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Smart Wellness Centers</h3><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Integrating intelligent devices with physical services, store operations, training and partner networks.</p></article></div></div></section><section data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"team\" id=\"team\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"team-header\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\">02 / LEADERSHIP &amp; TEAM</div><h2 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"section-heading\">Our People</h2></div><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"intro\">Combining strategic planning, business development, operations and health-tech applications to advance CUCA’s long-term goals.</p></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"team-tabs\" aria-label=\"团队类别\"><button data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" type=\"button\" class=\"team-tab\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All Profiles</button></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"team-status\">Loading team…</div></div></section><section data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"philosophy\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container philosophy-grid\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\">CULTURE &amp; VALUES</div><h2 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Technology creates value.<br>People build trust.</h2><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">We explore the intersection of technology and wellness through professionalism, transparency, collaboration and innovation.</p></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"values\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"value\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">01 / TRUST</strong><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Integrity &amp; Accountability</h3><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Building trust with clear information and responsible processes.</small></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"value\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">02 / INNOVATION</strong><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Innovation &amp; Action</h3><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Applying technology to real-world services.</small></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"value\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">03 / COLLABORATION</strong><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Openness &amp; Collaboration</h3><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Working with partners to strengthen the ecosystem.</small></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"value\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">04 / LONG-TERM</strong><h3 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Long-term Growth</h3><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Developing capabilities for sustainable operations.</small></div></div></div></section><section data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"contact\" id=\"contact\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container contact-inner\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"eyebrow\">LET'S CONNECT</div><h2 data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Partnerships start with a conversation.</h2><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Let’s discuss AI robotics, health technology and wellness center opportunities.</p></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"contact-actions\"><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"mailto:cuca13699@gmail.com?subject=CUCA%20Collaboration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Email Our Team</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">↗</span></a><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"/en\" class=\"ghost\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Back to Home</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">↗</span></a></div></div></section></main><footer data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"footer\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"container\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"footer-main\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"/en\" class=\"brand\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"brand-symbol\">C</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"brand-word\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">CUCA</strong><small data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">AI ROBOT · 2028</small></span></a><p data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"footer-about\">CUCA HEALTH &amp; WELLNESS PTE. LTD.<br>Singapore-based wellness technology and robotics applications platform.</p></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"footer-links\"><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Explore CUCA</strong><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"#about\">About CUCA</a><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"#team\">Our Team</a><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"#business\">Our Business</a></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\"><strong data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Contact Us</strong><a data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" href=\"mailto:cuca13699@gmail.com\">cuca13699@gmail.com</a><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">111 Somerset Road #05-02</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Singapore 238164</span></div></div></div><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"footer-base\"><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">© 2026 CUCA HEALTH &amp; WELLNESS PTE. LTD.</span><span data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\">Concept preview; company and team information is subject to final review.</span></div></div></footer><div data-v-a4bd5d2e=\"\" class=\"modal\" aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"modalName\"><!----></div></div></div></div><div id=\"teleports\"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUXT__.config={public:{siteUrl:\"https://www.airobot2028.com\",apiBase:\"https://www.airobot2028.com\",apiOrigin:\"https://www.airobot2028.com\",i18n:{baseUrl:\"https://www.airobot2028.com\",defaultLocale:\"zh\",rootRedirect:\"\",redirectStatusCode:302,skipSettingLocaleOnNavigate:false,locales:[{code:\"zh\",language:\"zh-CN\",name:\"中文\"},{code:\"en\",language:\"en-US\",name:\"English\"}],detectBrowserLanguage:{alwaysRedirect:false,cookieCrossOrigin:false,cookieDomain:\"\",cookieKey:\"cuca_locale\",cookieSecure:false,fallbackLocale:\"\",redirectOn:\"root\",useCookie:true},experimental:{localeDetector:\"\",typedPages:true,typedOptionsAndMessages:false,alternateLinkCanonicalQueries:true,devCache:false,cacheLifetime:\"\",stripMessagesPayload:false,preload:false,strictSeo:false,nitroContextDetection:true,httpCacheDuration:10,compactRoutes:false,prerenderMessages:false},domainLocales:{zh:{domain:\"\"},en:{domain:\"\"}}}},app:{baseURL:\"/\",buildId:\"14255021-13ab-4fe4-989c-21738d2e3c44\",buildAssetsDir:\"/_nuxt/